<section class="section" id="about">
  <h2>About Reno</h2>
  <p class="lead">
    I'm Reno, an
    <a href="https://www.fitnessalberta.com/">Fitness Alberta</a>-certified
    fitness trainer and certified kickboxing coach in Calgary. I help clients build strength,
    lose weight and develop habits that last, through structured training and practical
    nutrition coaching.
  </p>
  <p class="lead">
    Outside the gym I'm a software developer and a father of two, so I understand how hard it can
    be to fit training into a busy week. Every program is built around your goals and your schedule.
  </p>
